# A loop that stores eight and more streams into one view, all of them a multiple of 4,096 bytes apart, is laid out once for each group of at most six. Streams that meet (`meeting`), a turn that reads (`reading`) and seven streams stay one loop. `streams` has two versions, with and without bounds checks.
